charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;3</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">124 (40.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">93 (30.6)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">19 (26.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">27 (38.0)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;4&#x02013;7</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">129 (42.4)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">127 (41.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">35 (49.3)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">23 (32.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7e;8</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">45 (14.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">82 (27.0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">16 (22.5)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">21 (29.6)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Fruits intake (pieces)</italic></td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7d;5</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">134 (44.1)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">74 (24.3)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">15 (21.1)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">19 (26.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;6&#x02013;9</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">90 (29.6)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">112 (36.8)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">28 (39.4)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">24 (33.8)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x02003;&#x02a7e;10</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">75 (24.7)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">116 (38.2)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">27 (38.0)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">28 (39.4)</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x000a0;</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50"><italic>Number of subjects</italic></td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">304 (100)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">304 (100)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">71 (100)</td><td align="char" valign="top" char="(" charoff="50">71 (100)</td></tr></tbody></table><table-wrap-foot><fn id="tbfnote1"><label>a</label><p>Some strata do not add up to the total because of a few missing values.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap> shows the distribution of study participants by gender and age, years of schooling, smoking and drinking habits, and intake of fruit and vegetables. A marked excess of current smokers and alcohol drinkers was found among cases compared to controls of each gender. After adjusting for smoking and drinking habits, there were no differences between cases and controls in years of schooling (data not shown).</p><p><xref rid="tbl2" ref-type="table">Table 2</xref> <table-wrap id="tbl2" position="float"><label>Table 2</label><caption><p content-type="table-title">Height, weight and body mass index: odds ratios (OR) and confidence intervals (95&#x00025; CI) for oral cavity and oropharyngeal cancer, Spain 1996&#x02013;1999</p></caption><table frame="hsides" rules="groups" border="1" width="85%"><colgroup><col align="left"/><col al